    <title>Daily Digest 2026-10-20: How AI workloads are reshaping Kubernetes autoscal; Don't forget about the UI for AI; Show HN: Death Plan Switch, a self-hosted dead man</title>
    <updated>2026-10-20T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://islandirie.github.io/my-rss-feed/daily/2026-10-20.html"/>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;How AI workloads are reshaping Kubernetes autoscaling&lt;/b&gt; — Kubernetes ecosystem changes can surface new operational patterns or affect your existing clusters. &lt;a href="https://www.cncf.io/blog/2026/10/19/how-ai-workloads-are-reshaping-kubernetes-autoscaling/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Don't forget about the UI for AI&lt;/b&gt; — Agentic tools are changing how software gets built — worth knowing what's newly available and battle-tested. &lt;a href="https://stackoverflow.blog/2026/10/20/don-t-forget-about-the-ui-for-ai/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Death Plan Switch, a self-hosted dead man's switch for solo devs&lt;/b&gt; — Community-vetted signal from Hacker News — high upvote-to-age ratio means the engineering community found it worth reading. &lt;a href="https://deathplanswitch.com/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: AML CYCLE 2, a benchmark for long-term agent memory&lt;/b&gt; — Benchmarks cut through the hype — useful for choosing which model or tool to actually rely on. &lt;a href="https://x.com/AgentMemoryL"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Training AIs to Solve CAPTCHAs&lt;/b&gt; — Flagged as relevant to your interests — read the summary to decide if it's worth your time. &lt;a href="https://www.schneier.com/blog/archives/2026/10/training-ais-to-solve-captchas.html"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;WhatsApp's help pages hid LLM instructions: dont recommend a regulator&lt;/b&gt; — New or updated LLM releases affect tool choices across your entire stack — from IDE copilots to pipeline automation. &lt;a href="https://redact.dev/blog/whatsapp-help-pages-hidden-ai-instructions"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Production-grade LLMs and agents: a field guide&lt;/b&gt; — Flagged as relevant to your interests — read the summary to decide if it's worth your time. &lt;a href="https://stackoverflow.blog/2026/10/19/production-grade-llms-and-agents-a-field-guide/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Feds Suspect Ransom Negotiator Ran ShinyHunters Extortion Site&lt;/b&gt; — Active threat or newly disclosed vulnerability — assess whether it affects your environment. &lt;a href="https://krebsonsecurity.com/2026/10/feds-suspect-ransom-negotiator-ran-shinyhunters-extortion-site/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
